+/// IQ2_S (patch 0050, Qwen3.6-35B-A3B): the weight Constant is u8
+/// [E, out, K/32, 8] holding four 10-bit grid indices per 32 values as
+/// little-endian u16. Assembly: Reshape -> Gather(lo,hi) -> Convert ->
+/// Add(lo, hi<<8) -> Gather(iq2s_grid f32 [1024, 8]) -> Reshape [.,32]. Signs:
+/// the zero-point Constant is u8 [E, out, K/32, 4] RAW bytes (bit j flips
+/// value j) -> Convert -> Unsqueeze -> BitwiseAnd(masks) -> Greater(0) ->
+/// Select(-1, +1) -> Reshape. The scale is f16 [E, out, K/32, 2] the low
+/// nibble's value for 0..15 and the high nibble's for 16..31, expanded in-graph
+/// to [.,32] (Broadcast) before the final Multiply -> Reshape [E, out, K].
+/// anchors: gridix (the u8 weight), signix, scale, reshape
+class ov::pass::pattern::op::NativeIq2sWeightsBlock : public ov::pass::pattern::op::Block {
+public:
+    NativeIq2sWeightsBlock();
+};
